					},
					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "EXAMPLE 1: FLOAT TO INT\nConnect a Float to the Int node and it will return a number with the decimal part chopped off. \nSo 1.23 becomes 1 and 7.89 becomes 7."
					}
